// Dialog :
"P3007233089" "I've had some astounding successes back here at the laboratory. How did your little exercise in brutality fare?"
// RandomFameString :
"P2180069177" "I saw some Clockwork suddenly rush off toward Neuron Technology Unlimited. I wonder if everything is alright."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3502939230" "It took some time before I cut through all the garbage and actually found a shred of <i>real</i> science in Neuron's genetic abominations.<br><br>These creatures are obviously built for combat. They have enhanced strength, toughness, and agility. Neuron's oversight is that their metabolism is running at a massively accelerated rate. Even after they're dead they maintain human body temperature for several hours.<br><br>The restraints are <i>clearly</i> manufactured by Neuron Technologies Unlimited, but they also contain small processors for a yet unknown reason. Don't fret, I'm no moron, my laboratory is fully shielded from any foreign signals.<br><br> I'm not yet certain why Neuron is continuing to mass produce these deformed failures, unless it is proof of the true extent of his capabilities. I would like to find out what Neuron is really up to at any rate. <color orange>I think it is time you hit one of his laboratories to look for answers.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P22485286" "Raid one of Neuron's Lab"
// SendOffString :
"P3694266843" "The little war you started between Neuron and Antimatter has, unfortunately, had an undesirable side-effect. Neuron Technologies Unlimited is under heavy guard, as are most of his other facilities here in <i>Neuron's Reach</i>.<br><br><color orange>Doctor Hetzfeld shudders with rage at the name.</color><br><br>Luckily, Neuron hasn't the time to plan out long term strategies, or contingencies. He is reactive. Thus it is up to us to be on the offensive.<br><br>He has commited all of his Clockwork to a rather uniform density across his areas of control. Neuron's total strategic failure is that he is assuming the attack will come from Antimatter. If we strike here, he will have to draw forces away from here and here to keep his coverage uniform, and that will open him up for the real attack from Antimatter!<br><br>As the chaos escalates you will be able to move unopposed!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2847014780" "Steal Data from Neuron's Labs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3636624412" "Neuron's forces aren't very dense, but they are uniform. You can expect a constant wave of reinforcements arriving the moment you start making trouble."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1717731604" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Progress</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1911273914" "The Clockwork at this facility aren't worrisome, it's the surrounding eight blocks worth that will come running at the first sign of trouble."
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P2255039393" "Data Download Started!"
// Script Variable FloaterMessage :
"P129902953" "Two Minutes To Download"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P772711050" "Downloading..."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1799890343" "Downloading, for real this time."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2744473848" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white> {HeroName}, Neuron's Clockwork are converging on your position. Don't let them to stop you!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1522991172" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>The mainframe should be around there somewhere.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>Once you find it, attach the downloader.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>It will only take 2 minutes to download that entire database!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3317318269" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>Ha ha ha! The data in the database is...<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>Wait! What!? <t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>No! That's impossible! <t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white> {HeroName}! Neuron had a Sludgepit on that database! <t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>My downloader has been downloading incredibly dense dummy files for the last 2 minutes!<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>You're going to have to hold out for another 5 minutes before it's done."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P551523433" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color LimeGreen><bgcolor white>Alright, that got the data! Now get out of there!"

