// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3593652273" "<shout>!SEC.PER = CWK.ATT"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1687767302" "<shout>This is Wolf-three-one, moving in!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2809183810" "<shout>Everyone on the ground NOW!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3002000593" "<shout>Forward teams are under heavy fire, let's go!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3780796221" "<shout>This is NOT a drill, get down, or you will be shot!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4033239193" "<shout>By Praetor orders, cease combat immediately!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P146590683" "<shout>Wolves, let's go!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P221267613" "<shout>Hua!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2512463631" "<shout>Alright, no more playing around!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3793098082" "<shout>Sooner or later they WILL run out of fight."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1095342575" "<shout>Send in everyone.<em t=2>EVERYONE!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3581493636" "<shout><em t=2>Everyone, sir?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3536215006" "Mainframe"
// Description :
"P754252835" "Download Data"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1169553929" "You access the computer"
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P826846204" "You have been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4099928398" "You finish accessing the computer"
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2570772963" "You attached the downloader to the mainframe, just two minutes and you are out of here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - EraseEvidence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3868961110" "Erase evidence that you were here"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P304846248" "You've ensured that your work here can't be tracked."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1673683781" "<color orange>Hetzfeld gives you a small downloader. He claims it can clean out a corporate database in less than two minutes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P110570386" "You've taken care of what your Contact wanted you to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2284884836" "<color orange>Hetzfeld cackles to himself, but under his rebreather it sounds like he's choking.</color><br><br>A minor miscalculation, easily handled by your amazing combat capabilities!<br><br>Now then, let's see that data.<br><br>Hrmmm.<br><br>...<br><br>...!<br><br>Interesting."
// RandomFameString :
"P3734981481" "I heard there was a massive Resistance attack on a research facility here in Neutropolis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3306701014" "Neuron has been careless once more! His failure will be my success!<br><br>He's moved on to a second stage of his experiments, and I must <i>unfortunately</i> admit, they are far more advanced than I could have guessed, given the information at hand. Either this data we got is false, or Neuron is getting help from someone else. There is no other explanation.<br><br>I <i>must</i> have a specimen to examine!<br><br>I've made sure someone else will do the heavy lifting for us this time."
// AcceptString :
"P3392527381" "Steal Specimens from Neuron"
// SendOffString :
"P617865309" "I've coerced one of those Resistance terrorist cells into attacking one of Neuron's genetics labs. Not only will it get us what we want, but it will also shift blame from your last visit onto those misguided cretins!<br><br>Heh heh, don't worry, they won't be a bother for <i>anyone</i> once they get inside. They'll get far more than they bargained for since the prisoners they thought they were rescuing turn out to be <color yellow>murderous experimental cyborgs!</color> Ah ha ha ha!<br><br>AH HA HA HA HAHAAA!<br><br>With the Resistance taking the heat, this will give you the opportunity to swoop in and <i>save the day</i>, but <color orange>make sure that the cyborgs are returned not to thier holding cells, but to mine instead!</color> Attach these <color yellow>teleporter beacons</color> to the experiments once they are defeated. They'll be transported directly to my lab's containment cells.<br><br>Neuron will be so busy chasing the Resistance to get his experiments back that he won't see me closing in for the coup de grace!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1469360152" "Steal Neuron's Cyborgs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1336153216" "Once you get me those cyborgs I'll really be able to accelerate my work!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1803368965" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: One Man's Trash...</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4128451857" "You pass the crushed and mangled bodies of Resistance members on your way inside."
// Script Variable NEGOTIATOR_ONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2411000080" "Territory - Hostile.<em>Orders - Execute primary mission."
// Script Variable NEGOTIATOR_TWO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2408136936" "<em t=1>Freedom... Corps."
// Script Variable NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3860471094" "Enemy detected...<em>Combat positions."
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P969680261" "Type 90"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P469471010" "Type 53"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - FreedomCorps 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1443155621" "What did that thing say?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3163481319" "Using Dr. Hetzfeld's teleportation beacons you stole all of the genetic experiments from Neuron's Lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P917422698" "Ha haaah ha ha ha!<br><br>I can only imagine the look on Neuron's stupid face when he realizes that his experiments have been stolen right out from under his nose, and apparently by the Resistance no less. Ah ha ha ha!<br><br>Such luck I have had with you. You are powerful, decisive, and completely unstoppable! With my genius and your power we are <i>destined</i> for greatness.<br><br>The time is nigh to prove to the world that Neuron is as an ant compared to <i>my</i> colossal intellect!<br><br>It has taken time to make the many and necessary modifications to the obviously flawed body of Neuron's work. But like Michaelangelo and his David, I have revealed the work of art hidden within the marble."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - RiptideDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P2310376846" "Something isn't right here..."
// Answer Text :
"P1831444868" "Hetzfeld sent me to kill you, in the name of science."
// Page Intro1Page1 Text :
"P2421007257" "He told me you were a traitor... And I believed him!<br><br><color orange>Riptide rips a familiar looking data recording device off of his shoulder pad and crushes it in his hand.</color><br><br>He tricked us into fighting! No matter which way the fight ended..."
// Answer Text :
"P1842840284" "...He'd get the best data. That little..."
// Page Intro1Page2 Text :
"P1487180700" "The man is insane, {HeroName}. Not just aspiring, he's a lunatic. I need to put a stop to him."
// Answer Text :
"P1074584257" "Way ahead of you."
// Page Intro1Page3 Text :
"P1994634156" ""I hesitate to suggest it - seeing as how you sacrificed Warrant, Aria, Zane, and even poor Stern - but we should work <i>together</i> to take Hetzfeld down."
// Answer Text :
"P1222040007" "Reese is dead, Riptide. They're avenged."
// Page Intro1Page4 Text :
"P2916984571" "Fine.<br><br>Report to Hetzfeld, convince him that you killed me. I'll sneak in through the sub-basement and then we'll take him down together."
// Answer Text :
"P3045440094" "Sounds like a plan, and is more believable than you beating me."
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P941048485" "{HeroName}, no, I can't believe that <i>you</i> are a traitor... You dropped everything to save Aria and the others...<br><br>What's going on here?"
// Answer Text :
"P1932118092" "You said Hetzfeld, are you working with him too?"
// Page Intro2Page1 Text :
"P2733276980" "Wait? You're working with Hetzfeld too?<br><br>Oh! That double crossing..."
// Answer Text :
"P2312103500" "He's using us, just like I'm using him."
// Page Intro2Page2 Text :
"P1439843569" "<color orange>Riptide rips a familiar looking data recorder off of his shoulder plate and fries it in his hand with a surge of electricity.</color><br><br>He's insane, you know that, right?"
// Answer Text :
"P353219131" "Insane, but capable. I was hoping Neuron would keep his focus."
// Page Intro2Page3 Text :
"P812968226" "No doubt whichever of us reported back is walking into a death trap... Are you thinking what I'm thinking?"
// Answer Text :
"P761498711" "We take him down together, before he knows his plan's been found out."
// Page Intro2Page4 Text :
"P2233483352" "I'll sneak into his lab and lie in wait. It's more believable if you report success than I."
// Answer Text :
"P259418810" "Sounds like a good plan."
// Page Intro3 Text :
"P4002412765" "{HeroName}! Stop... We can fight later, but right now, something's wrong."
// Answer Text :
"P3447850088" "You were about to lose, that's what's wrong."
// Page Intro3Page1 Text :
"P3626340532" ""<color orange>Riptide looks at the data recorder you are carrying and snarls, ramming one of his spines through it and slinging it across the room.</color><br><br>Hetzfeld!"
// Answer Text :
"P4044632065" "You're working with him as well?"
// Page Intro3Page2 Text :
"P2897857675" "He told me to gather combat data by killing you. I refused at first, but then he said you were a traitor and had attacked one of Antimatter's facilities.<br><br>He played me."
// Answer Text :
"P3874328669" "I was planning on betraying him, he beat me to it."
// Page Intro3Page3 Text :
"P160671313" "We'll do it together. You report back to Hetzfeld and get him into his lab. I'll be waiting for him there."
// Answer Text :
"P1739257991" "How can I trust you?"
// Page Intro3Page4 Text :
"P2362041542" "You have my word of honor. It may or may not mean anything to you, but it means a lot to me.<br><br>Besides, you've beaten me once already."
// Answer Text :
"P962176475" "Fair enough. Let's do this."
// Page Intro4 Text :
"P733334923" "I don't know who you are, but something is fishy about all this..."
// Answer Text :
"P2992800232" "You don't say?"
// Page Intro4Page1 Text :
"P2932260818" ""Cute.<br><br><color orange>Riptide looks at the data recorder you are carrying and snarls, ramming one of his spines through it and slinging it across the room.</color><br><br>Hetzfeld!"
// Answer Text :
"P3274703031" ""Sounds like a plan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HetzfeldDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ComeBack Text :
"P2020508893" "Come now, I want you to be the first to see what I have been working on. Are you ready to see the power we have worked so hard for?"
// Answer Text :
"P2796066040" ""I'm ready." (Enter Lab)"
// Answer Text :
"P1565268754" ""Not just yet." (Leave)"
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P1772518801" "<color deepskyblue>For The Taking</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Finale: ...For The Taking!</color>Excellent! Excellent! No doubt you had a savage battle with that <i>creature</i>, Riptide. I will need to analyze the combat data immediately."
// Answer Text :
"P1472192552" "I think you'll find it intriguing."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P406763622" ""{HeroName}, soon we shall prove that I am the <i>only</i> logical choice for Praetor of the Sciences. Cole will be forced to recognize that your efforts will directly bring about the destruction of all our enemies.<br><br>With my advanced combat cyborgs, which are superior in every way to Neuron's trash heaps, using your battle data, nobody will stand in <i>my</i> path to glory!<br><br>...<br><br>I mean, <i>our</i> path to glory... come, join me in my laboratory when you are ready."
// Answer Text :
"P3798789151" ""Sure thing, doc." (Enter Lab)"
// Answer Text :
"P2469319933" ""Give me a minute." (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4107815554" "I've completely rewritten the genetic sequencers of his earlier work; the Ghouls, and solved the ridiculous metabolic catastrophe that beleaguered those moronic creations. But now, with some of Neuron's second stage cyborgs I have the opportunity to improve upon his designs once more!<br><br>They will not be perfect, however, until your contribution is made..."
// AcceptString :
"P3935487378" "Contribution?"
// SendOffString :
"P1161546409" "Oh... Oh! Yes, yes yes, I apologize for my <i>enthusiasm</i>, but the taste of victory is at hand, and it is intoxicating. I have yet to tell you your part in all of this.<br><br>Your prowess is unmatched by all but a select few, {HeroName}. I'd like to use you as the combat template for my new <i>super cyborgs</i>. By gathering your combat data I will upgrade the rudimentary combat parameters installed on their memory implants. The tougher the fight, the better the data.<br><br>I've already identified the most capable target. He's one of <color yellow>Praetor White's Top Dogs</color>, so he must be extraordinarily tough. I had a tracer planted on him, and it looks like he's currently down in the tunnels.<br><br><color orange>Kill him.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3150734048" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five: ...Is Another Man's Treasure...</color>"

