"P418232028" "<shout>Found you, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1082681099" "<shout>Hetzfeld was right on the money!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P509507608" "Turning to fight, huh? Well I can admire that."
