"P650397048" "Doctor Hetzfeld"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1799692890" "Good of you to make it, {HeroName}! Come closer!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4094360402" "I can still salvage you for more parts!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3707469135" "You were a brilliant test subject, I couldn't have asked for a better one!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2513673238" "Ooomph! W-wait, hold on! Let's not get too rash!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P146258279" "No... I never got...<em>...to destroy...<em>...N-neuron..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2755587053" "<em evillaugh>Thank you for showing up, {HeroName}!<em>Good news! The cyborgs are a success and follow my every command!<em>Bad news! I'm going to use them to kill you!<em>It's been a pleasure working with you, but now...<em>DIE!<em>...!?<em>No... no no no no no!<em grief>Not you fools! {HeroName} is the one who is supposed to DIE!<em>Stop! Stopstopstopstopstop!<em>No! Not like this!<em>So...<em>{HeroName}... about that... betrayal...<em>...<em>...! I have more ghouls! DIE!"

